{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"voipDidCancelCall","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"voipMessage","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@PushwooshVoIP@objc(cs)PWVoIPMessage","text":"PWVoIPMessage"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:@M@PushwooshVoIP@objc(pl)PWVoIPCallDelegate(im)voipDidCancelCallWithVoipMessage:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshVoIP"}],"title":"voipDidCancelCall(voipMessage:)","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"voipDidCancelCallWithVoipMessage:"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshVoIP\/documentation\/PushwooshVoIP","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshVoIP\/documentation\/PushwooshVoIP\/PWVoIPCallDelegate"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Called when a call is remotely cancelled via VoIP push before the user answers.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"optional","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"voipDidCancelCall"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"voipMessage","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PWVoIPMessage","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@PushwooshVoIP@objc(cs)PWVoIPMessage","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshVoIP\/documentation\/PushwooshVoIP\/PWVoIPMessage"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The VoIP message containing call information. Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"voipMessage.callId"},{"type":"text","text":" to identify which call was cancelled."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"voipMessage"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is invoked when the remote party cancels their outgoing call before the local user has a chance to answer."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The SDK automatically dismisses the CallKit incoming call UI when this occurs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To enable call cancellation, include these fields in your VoIP push payload:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"callId"},{"type":"text","text":" - A unique server-provided identifier for the call"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cancelCall"},{"type":"text","text":" - Set to "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for cancellation requests"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK matches cancellation requests to active calls using the "},{"code":"callId","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field. When a cancellation push is received,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"CallKit UI is automatically dismissed with "},{"code":"CXCallEndedReason.remoteEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is an optional delegate method. If not implemented, the SDK will still automatically dismiss the CallKit UI."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancellation only works for calls that haven’t been answered yet. Once answered, cancellation requests are ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshVoIP\/d